{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836376",
      "title": "Exposing Component APIs via the useImperativeHandle Hook",
      "sourceHash": "fb7f470040ba7d4a6da7d6750b0f819cc6d945840763cd06ffb5d10d651c2c94",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.72,
          "end": 2.34,
          "en": "Now this approach here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.34,
          "end": 6.51,
          "en": "where we forward this ref to this dialog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.51,
          "end": 9.84,
          "en": "has one small potential flaw,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.84,
          "end": 11.79,
          "en": "because the problem with that is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.79,
          "end": 14.1,
          "en": "that the timer challenge component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.1,
          "end": 17.61,
          "en": "which uses the ResultModal component in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.61,
          "end": 21.48,
          "en": "needs to know that this dialog ref here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.48,
          "end": 25.08,
          "en": "will be attached to this dialog element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.08,
          "end": 28.59,
          "en": "And of course here, in this tiny demo application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.59,
          "end": 32.19,
          "en": "where we are the only developer working on it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.19,
          "end": 33.9,
          "en": "that's absolutely no problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.9,
          "end": 37.173,
          "en": "because we wrote this code, we know what it does.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.43,
          "end": 40.89,
          "en": "But keep in mind that you might eventually work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.89,
          "end": 44.67,
          "en": "on bigger React projects and that there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.67,
          "end": 47.25,
          "en": "you might be writing some components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.25,
          "end": 50.613,
          "en": "and other developers write other components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.51,
          "end": 54.72,
          "en": "And you might be working with some of those components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.72,
          "end": 57.393,
          "en": "written by other developers and vice versa.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.71,
          "end": 61.71,
          "en": "If you don't always have to dive into those components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.71,
          "end": 64.77,
          "en": "to understand how they work internally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.77,
          "end": 67.47,
          "en": "so that you use them correctly and you for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.47,
          "end": 70.38,
          "en": "call the correct method on that ref here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.38,
          "end": 72.36,
          "en": "that can be a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.36,
          "end": 74.34,
          "en": "If that other developer, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.34,
          "end": 78.75,
          "en": "switches from a dialog to a div, you are lost,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.75,
          "end": 81.993,
          "en": "because now calling showModal won't work anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.85,
          "end": 87,
          "en": "Therefore, it might be preferable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87,
          "end": 90.39,
          "en": "to build this ResultModal component such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.39,
          "end": 94.47,
          "en": "that it exposes its own function that can be called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.47,
          "end": 97.65,
          "en": "with help of a ref outside of that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.65,
          "end": 102.50999999999999,
          "en": "So from here for example, which will work independent of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.50999999999999,
          "end": 106.38,
          "en": "how this JSX code might change in the future,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.38,
          "end": 109.947,
          "en": "so that the person working on that ResultModal component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.947,
          "end": 112.59,
          "en": "can change it however they want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.59,
          "end": 115.83,
          "en": "as long as they keep this one function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.83,
          "end": 117.69,
          "en": "which is exposed to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.69,
          "end": 120.36,
          "en": "which you call on this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.36,
          "end": 122.43,
          "en": "on this ResultModal component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.43,
          "end": 124.59,
          "en": "instead of calling showModal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.59,
          "end": 127.263,
          "en": "on that internal dialog element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.4,
          "end": 131.4,
          "en": "And this is something that can be achieved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.4,
          "end": 134.55,
          "en": "by using another special hook in the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.55,
          "end": 137.883,
          "en": "that wants to expose such a callable function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.05,
          "end": 143.493,
          "en": "It's the useImperativeHandle hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.81,
          "end": 148.45,
          "en": "You can call this hook in this component function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.15,
          "end": 153.32999999999998,
          "en": "to define properties and methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.32999999999998,
          "end": 156.72,
          "en": "that should be accessible on this component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 156.72,
          "end": 159.63,
          "en": "from outside this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 159.63,
          "end": 161.19,
          "en": "And I will say right away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.19,
          "end": 164.19,
          "en": "that you won't use this hook too often",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.19,
          "end": 165.93,
          "en": "because in most cases,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.93,
          "end": 168.963,
          "en": "you should prefer working with props and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.92000000000002,
          "end": 173.82,
          "en": "But for use cases like this, this hook can be very helpful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.82,
          "end": 177.4,
          "en": "to make this component more stable and reusable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.26,
          "end": 183.03,
          "en": "and useImperativeHandle wants two arguments now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.03,
          "end": 187.41,
          "en": "and the first argument should be a ref object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 187.41,
          "end": 189.21,
          "en": "as you for example receive it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 189.21,
          "end": 192,
          "en": "from your forwardRef function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 192,
          "end": 194.973,
          "en": "so this second parameter I'm getting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 196.29,
          "end": 199.92000000000002,
          "en": "Now of course, if you are not using forwardRef,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.92000000000002,
          "end": 202.5,
          "en": "because you are in a React project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.5,
          "end": 206.19,
          "en": "that's using at least React version 19 or higher",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 206.19,
          "end": 208.77,
          "en": "and you therefore don't need forwardRef,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 208.77,
          "end": 212.46,
          "en": "you would of course simply use the ref that you are getting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 212.46,
          "end": 215.07,
          "en": "and extracting as a regular prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 215.07,
          "end": 219.32999999999998,
          "en": "and you would pass that to useImperativeHandle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219.32999999999998,
          "end": 222.3,
          "en": "because ultimately, useImperativeHandle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 222.3,
          "end": 227.3,
          "en": "simply wants a ref, a ref that's passed to this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 228.15,
          "end": 231.51,
          "en": "Now here, I'm getting it with help of forwardRef",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 231.51,
          "end": 234.75,
          "en": "since I deliberately used forwardRef in this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 234.75,
          "end": 238.2,
          "en": "project to show you how this function would work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 238.2,
          "end": 241.53,
          "en": "because you might need it in older react projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 241.53,
          "end": 244.26,
          "en": "But useImperativeHandle of course also works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 244.26,
          "end": 246.45,
          "en": "with more recent react versions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 246.45,
          "end": 248.853,
          "en": "where you might not use forwardRef.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 250.11,
          "end": 252.45,
          "en": "Either way, the ref parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 252.45,
          "end": 256.47,
          "en": "the ref argument here isn't the only argument that's wanted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 256.47,
          "end": 258.36,
          "en": "by useImperativeHandle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 258.36,
          "end": 261.84,
          "en": "Instead, it also wants a second argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 261.84,
          "end": 266.1,
          "en": "And this second value then must be a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 266.1,
          "end": 270.78,
          "en": "that then returns an object which groups all the properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 270.78,
          "end": 274.05,
          "en": "and methods that should be exposed by this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 274.05,
          "end": 275.403,
          "en": "to other components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 276.9,
          "end": 280.71,
          "en": "For example, here we could expose a open method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 280.71,
          "end": 284.19,
          "en": "though this name here is totally up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 284.19,
          "end": 286.74,
          "en": "but it's this method that will soon be callable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 286.74,
          "end": 289.23,
          "en": "from outside this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 289.23,
          "end": 291.12,
          "en": "Now with that added here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 291.12,
          "end": 295.40999999999997,
          "en": "we should also import the useRef hook here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 295.40999999999997,
          "end": 297.61,
          "en": "in this ResultModal component file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 298.74,
          "end": 302.52,
          "en": "and execute useRef in the ResultModal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 302.52,
          "end": 305.31,
          "en": "Because now, we'll need a separate ref",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 305.31,
          "end": 309.81,
          "en": "for reaching out to the dialog because the idea now is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 309.81,
          "end": 313.32,
          "en": "to detach this dialog element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 313.32,
          "end": 316.17,
          "en": "which is used in this ResultModal component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 316.17,
          "end": 319.14,
          "en": "from any other outer components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 319.14,
          "end": 322.203,
          "en": "So from the timer challenge component for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 323.85,
          "end": 326.4,
          "en": "Therefore, we'll add a new ref here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 326.4,
          "end": 329.853,
          "en": "which I'll name dialog like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 330.72,
          "end": 334.29,
          "en": "And it's now this dialog ref which is passed as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 334.29,
          "end": 336.153,
          "en": "to the ref prop to the dialog.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 337.32,
          "end": 339.39,
          "en": "And it's now in this open method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 339.39,
          "end": 342.87,
          "en": "in this object returned here by this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 342.87,
          "end": 345,
          "en": "which is passed as a second argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 345,
          "end": 347.58,
          "en": "to useImperativeHandle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 347.58,
          "end": 350.25,
          "en": "It's this open method where I now want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 350.25,
          "end": 354.03,
          "en": "to use this dialog ref and they're the current property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 354.03,
          "end": 355.473,
          "en": "to call showModal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 356.79,
          "end": 359.01,
          "en": "so that when this open method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 359.01,
          "end": 362.853,
          "en": "is called the showModal method on this dialog is called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 364.53,
          "end": 367.05,
          "en": "And now with that setup here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 367.05,
          "end": 369.25,
          "en": "we can go back to the timer challenge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 370.29,
          "end": 374.31,
          "en": "and there, this dialog ref is now connected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 374.31,
          "end": 376.86,
          "en": "to our ResultModal still,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 376.86,
          "end": 379.5,
          "en": "but under the hood it will basically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 379.5,
          "end": 382.62,
          "en": "you could say refer to this object now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 382.62,
          "end": 385.263,
          "en": "That's what useImperativeHandle does here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 386.88,
          "end": 389.52,
          "en": "And therefore, we're now able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 389.52,
          "end": 393.933,
          "en": "to use dialog.current.open here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 395.25,
          "end": 397.11,
          "en": "Because this open method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 397.11,
          "end": 401.973,
          "en": "which I'm calling here is this open method I defined here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 403.08,
          "end": 406.2,
          "en": "Because as I just mentioned, it's now this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 406.2,
          "end": 409.83,
          "en": "that's in the end stored in this dialog ref here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 409.83,
          "end": 412.203,
          "en": "in the timer challenge component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 413.28,
          "end": 415.11,
          "en": "Because we're passing dialog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 415.11,
          "end": 417.843,
          "en": "as a value for ref to ResultModal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 418.92,
          "end": 422.55,
          "en": "And thanks to forwardRef and useImperativeHandle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 422.55,
          "end": 426.003,
          "en": "this connection to this object here is established.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 427.47,
          "end": 431.44,
          "en": "So it's now this open method which is called from here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 432.42,
          "end": 435.51,
          "en": "and therefore now, if you save this as a result,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 435.51,
          "end": 439.08,
          "en": "if you start this challenge and you don't stop it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 439.08,
          "end": 441.84,
          "en": "we got the same result as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 441.84,
          "end": 445.86,
          "en": "but now we detached the timer challenge component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 445.86,
          "end": 450.06,
          "en": "from the dialog element in this ResultModal component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 450.06,
          "end": 452.37,
          "en": "And we could now change this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
